    <span class="marquee-kicker">Behind the picks</span>
    <h1 id="about-title">About Eat My Movies</h1>
    <p>I'm James, the UK-based film fan behind Eat My Movies. I select and rank the films on these lists using my own viewing experience and judgement. The lists reflect my personal recommendations rather than an aggregate score.</p>
    <h2>How recommendations work</h2>
    <p>The movie finder starts with films in our curated collection. It matches your mood to lists and genres, then filters by the running time, release period and language choices you make. It shuffles the matching films so another visit can bring a different suggestion.</p>
    <h2>How the lists are ranked</h2>
    <p>I put each list in an order that reflects my own favourites and what I think makes each film worth watching. The introductions explain why a category earns a place here. Movie of the Week highlights one film with a fresh editorial note.</p>
    <p>Film facts, posters and some descriptions come from TMDb and other credited sources. The selections and rankings are mine. <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">Get in touch</a> if you have a suggestion or spot an error.</p>
</section>
